  <!--
    线性图标：Lucide（ISC 许可，见 Assets/Icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt），原样转成 24×24 的描边路径，没有运行时依赖。
    用法：<PathIcon/> 不行（它是填充），用 Classes="icon" 的 Path：Data="{StaticResource Icon.Play}"。Every path starts with "M0 0 M24 24": two bare moves that draw nothing but keep the full 24×24 box,
    so Stretch="Uniform" scales every icon the same way and keeps it centred. Without them a chevron or the "⋯" was
    scaled from its own ink bounds and pinned to the top-left of its box.
